    "guide": {
      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "installation": "```sh\nflavor=night\ncurl -fsSL --create-dirs -o \"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/fzf/living-code-$flavor.sh\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/living-code-theme/fzf/main/living-code-$flavor.sh\"\n```\n\nThen source it from `~/.bashrc` or `~/.zshrc`:\n\n```sh\n. \"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/fzf/living-code-night.sh\"\n```\n\nFor fish, download `living-code-$flavor.fish` from the same folder of the repository instead and `source` it from `config.fish`. Source it after any line that sets `FZF_DEFAULT_OPTS`.",
      "configuration": "See [fzf's documentation](https://github.com/junegunn/fzf) for application settings and reload behavior. The activation instructions above identify each supported flavor; keep your other application configuration.",
      "compatibility": "This port supplies theme files for fzf, not the application itself. Install the application separately and follow the installation instructions for its supported configuration format.",
